      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benbow%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2022, Benbow earned national recognition as a Firewise Community, covering nearly 3,000 acres of fire‑safe land.",
